{
  "summary": "The experiment tested a multimodal approach combining RNA (PCA-n2000) and image (ResNet50) data via simple concatenation fusion, without aggregation. Validation accuracy of 0.5266 and F1 of 0.5104 suggest moderate performance, providing an initial baseline for multimodal integration. Uncertainty remains about the relative impact of alternative fusion strategies or modalities, as no comparative experiments have been conducted."
}

